<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nabors Industries started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nabors Industries started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Terry Darling initiated coverage of Nabors Industries Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 1-1/32 to 32-3/4.</p>
</text>
